			},
			"date": "2024-01-29T14:25:52.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Thinking about it from an <a href=\"https://mastodon.cc/tags/IndieWeb\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>IndieWeb</span></a> perspective, is this a use case for a linkblog and syndicating that post from your own website out to your various social accounts?</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "111839705752317429",
			"parentId": "111839697639560584",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/111839705752317429",
