				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-01-29T14:27:58.887Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.cc/@jgarber\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>jgarber</span></a></span> I like the idea but really I think I’m looking for a way to see a post on a social network and then semi-automatically boost from the other networks that the author has posted it to (that I also have an account on)</p><p>I don’t necessarily want the noise of another independent post on my site</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
