				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/287/954/905/181/617/original/1276d73765f37a08.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-01-29T17:17:24.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Ehh I've conceded to just doing it all manually and choosing which platform to boost what. The discrepancies between them all is just enough that I don't think an all-in-one is going to be enough. It's why I fell out with those all-in-one messenger apps, you kinda miss out on the native quirks of each platform</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
