			},
			"date": "2024-01-29T17:37:01.802Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.cc/@jgarber\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>jgarber</span></a></span> has me wondering if I actually want a search engine that works with social networks <a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/111840445908110197\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachle</span><span class=\"invisible\">at/111840445908110197</span></a></p><p>why didn’t google ever build this</p>",
