			},
			"date": "2024-01-29T17:43:32.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I was about to suggest making a shortcut to search for URLs but both LinkedIn and Threads make it difficult to get any results at all. LinkedIn can be searched but only using Google, and Threads is too JS to even be indexed 😭</p>",
